      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The paper is concerned with the results of a study of volume regulation in 102 patients with CHD complicated by heart failure. Disorder of the volumetric natriuretic reflex at the early stages of heart failure was shown. A conclusion was made of disorder of all links of volume regulation in patients with heart failure."},
